Reahi
$cards
DECK 1 SPADES

$initial
CRACU 4 FACE_LAST
CRACU 7 FACE_LAST
CRACU 2 FACE_LAST

$moves
MOVE CRACU CRACU
SRC Suit {SPADES}
MOVE_STACK CRACU CRACU
AND
    DEST Rank K
    OR
        DESTSRC Rank equal
        DEST Rank K
$win
OR
    AND
        PILE ALL CRACU Empty
        PILE ALL CRACU Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL CRACU Empty
        PILE ALL CRACU Empty
